\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Extended Agentic SABRE pipeline. Three modality-specific base detectors (Semantic CNN, Behavioural CNN, Knowledge CNN) produce mean--uncertainty pairs via MC Dropout. The Peer Consultation module adjusts agent probabilities under high local uncertainty before scores enter the Score Pool. CTGAN augments the pool during training. A Decision MLP, tuned by Bayesian optimisation and calibrated by temperature scaling, produces the fused risk estimate $\hat  {p}$. The Triage Policy maps $(\hat  {p}, \sigma _{\qopname  \relax m{max}})$ to one of four decisions. Analyst corrections from the Expert Feedback Loop incrementally retrain the Decision MLP.\relax }}{4}{}\protected@file@percent }
